<body>
  <header>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Error XS9271</para>
  </header>
  <para styleclass="Normal">The type 'Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.EmbeddedAttribute' must be non-generic, internal, sealed, non-static, have a parameterless constructor, inherit from System.Attribute, and be able to be applied to any type.</para>
  <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
